VAL_ 953 STATE_ALT 0 "EMPTY" 1 "TENTATIVE" 2 "MEASURED" 3 "COASTED" ;
VAL_ 953 MOTION_STATE 0 "UNKNOWN" 1 "STATIONARY" 2 "MOVING" ;
VAL_ 953 STATE 0 "EMPTY" 1 "TENTATIVE_1" 2 "TENTATIVE_2" 3 "MEASURED" 4 "COASTED" 7 "UNRESOLVED_TENTATIVE" ;
    CM_ BO_ 953 "Common Hyundai/Kia/Genesis 3A5-3C4 track layout, validated across HDA1/HDA2 and CCNC/non-CCNC routes. Rich width, length, absolute-speed, orientation, and shape data was populated only on EV9/Ioniq 9 in the tested corpus; HDA2 alone does not imply support, and the extension attributes belong to the same 32 tracks rather than extra objects. The HKG CAN-FD checksum uses the CAN address as its data ID. No dedicated oncoming value or flag was found; bit 29 remained zero even for physics-based oncoming candidates. Bits 26, 29, 39, 55, 117, 136-137, 143, 171, and 188-191 remained zero and are reserved. The Sportage HEV 2026 route uses an incompatible overlapping layout and must not be decoded with this DBC.";
CM_ SG_ 953 CHECKSUM "16-bit HKG CAN-FD checksum using the CAN address as the data ID.";
CM_ SG_ 953 COUNTER "8-bit transmit-cycle counter. It covers 0-255 and wraps; it is separate from the per-track update counter.";
CM_ SG_ 953 STATE_ALT "Compressed STATE mirror: 0=empty, 1=tentative/unresolved, 2=measured, 3=coasted.";
CM_ SG_ 953 MOTION_STATE "Ground-frame target-motion class: 0=unknown, 1=stationary, 2=moving. Related Hyundai radar data defines the unused fourth 2-bit value as stopped, not oncoming; that bit remained zero throughout the tested 3A5 corpus.";
CM_ SG_ 953 TRACK_COUNTER "Per-track modulo-4 update counter. It normally advances with AGE and may hold between updates.";
CM_ SG_ 953 TRACK_QUALITY "Unsigned 7-bit track quality/existence score. Empty and tentative tracks are low, measured tracks are high, and coasted tracks decline as COAST_AGE increases. A related Hyundai object layout defines its 7-bit quality level as reliability, validity, or probability evidence; the raw radar scale is not confirmed to be a percentage.";
CM_ SG_ 953 AGE "Per-track alive age/lifetime count, observed 0-255. It normally increments by one on an update and may hold.";
CM_ SG_ 953 COAST_AGE "Prediction age: normally 0 in measured STATE=3, starts at 1 in coasted STATE=4, and increments to 15.";
CM_ SG_ 953 STATE "Track lifecycle: 0=empty, 1/2=tentative acquisition, 3=measured, 4=coasted/predicted, 7=unresolved tentative. Values 5 and 6 were not observed.";
CM_ SG_ 953 RCS "Signed radar cross-section/return-strength value. Distance-controlled samples consistently increase from small to passenger to large targets, and its distribution closely matches the detailed 210-21F field. The raw unit is not calibrated.";
CM_ SG_ 953 LONG_DIST "Longitudinal distance from the ego radar. The 13th bit continues through 204.8 m rather than being a flag. STATE=0 may carry endpoint sentinels.";
CM_ SG_ 953 LAT_DIST "Lateral position relative to the ego axis. STATE=0 values are empty-track data, not target positions.";
CM_ SG_ 953 REL_SPEED "Longitudinal speed relative to ego; negative means the target is moving longitudinally slower than ego.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_4 "Unknown category, observed 0-2. Zero dominates; 1/2 occur more often on moving targets.";
CM_ SG_ 953 REL_LAT_SPEED "Target lateral speed relative to the ego vehicle axis.";
CM_ SG_ 953 REL_ACCEL "Target longitudinal acceleration relative to ego acceleration.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_18 "Unknown optional measurement-status attribute. EV9/Ioniq 9 use 1/2 almost exclusively for measured STATE=3 tracks and 0 for coasted STATE=4 tracks; the distinction between 1 and 2 is unknown. The rare value 3 is also observed.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_5 "Unknown sparse optional attribute. Observed 0-32 and almost always 0; no stable correlation was found.";
CM_ SG_ 953 WIDTH "Strongly identified target width in 0.1 m units from recurring approximately 2.0 m passenger cars. Observed 0.0-3.0 m; many platforms transmit 0. Every address in the range can carry it.";
CM_ SG_ 953 LENGTH "Strongly identified target length in 0.1 m units from approximately 4.0 m cars and 13.0-15.5 m long vehicles. This is an 8-bit field; many platforms transmit 0.";
CM_ SG_ 953 ABS_SPEED "Strongly inferred absolute target-speed magnitude. On Ioniq 9 it matches hypot(ego speed + REL_SPEED, REL_LAT_SPEED), including targets without dimensions; observed 0.0-54.4 m/s.";
CM_ SG_ 953 ORIENTATION_ANGLE "Strongly inferred target orientation relative to the ego axis. Moving vehicles cluster near 0 degrees; it is associated with dimension-bearing targets. Values near +/-180 can be real rearward orientation on rich tracks, while non-rich platforms use +180 as an unavailable/default value.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_13 "Unknown optional 0-10 shape/geometry metric, nonzero only on dimension-bearing targets in tested routes.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_12 "Strong geometry-age/maturity candidate: two Ioniq 9 routes progressed 0, 1, 2, ... 10 and saturated at 10. Cross-platform confirmation is still insufficient for a semantic rename.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_14 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-3. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_15 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-2. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
CM_ SG_ 953 NEW_SIGNAL_16 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-3. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
