CM_ SG_ 955 LENGTH "Strongly identified target length in 0.1 m units from approximately 4.0 m cars and 13.0-15.5 m long vehicles. This is an 8-bit field; many platforms transmit 0.";
CM_ SG_ 955 ABS_SPEED "Strongly inferred absolute target-speed magnitude. On Ioniq 9 it matches hypot(ego speed + REL_SPEED, REL_LAT_SPEED), including targets without dimensions; observed 0.0-54.4 m/s.";
CM_ SG_ 955 ORIENTATION_ANGLE "Strongly inferred target orientation relative to the ego axis. Moving vehicles cluster near 0 degrees; it is associated with dimension-bearing targets. Values near +/-180 can be real rearward orientation on rich tracks, while non-rich platforms use +180 as an unavailable/default value.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_13 "Unknown optional 0-10 shape/geometry metric, nonzero only on dimension-bearing targets in tested routes.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_12 "Strong geometry-age/maturity candidate: two Ioniq 9 routes progressed 0, 1, 2, ... 10 and saturated at 10. Cross-platform confirmation is still insufficient for a semantic rename.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_14 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-3. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_15 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-2. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_16 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-3. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";
CM_ SG_ 955 NEW_SIGNAL_17 "Unknown optional geometry category, observed 0-2. The common NEW_SIGNAL_14-17 tuple is 2,2,2,1.";

